<title>UK: LG Elec in fridge jv talks with GE.</title>
<headline>LG Elec in fridge jv talks with GE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>LG Electronics Inc, a unit of South Korea's LG Group, said on Wednesday it was considering a possible joint venture with General Electric Co for manufacturing large-sized refrigerators.</p>
<p>It said in a statement seen in London that financial details and the joint venture ratio had not been decided yet, but it planned to reveal more detailed information in the first half of this year.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
